            <p style="font-size:16.5px; line-height:1.6; color:#9AA0C3; margin:18px 0 0;">Every solved thread can publish to a fast, near-zero-JS page on your own <span style="color:#C4B5FD; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:14px;">slug.dejavue.app</span> subdomain — or a custom domain. Each channel becomes a category; pages carry QA &amp; FAQ structured data so people find answers before they ask.</p>
            <ul style="list-style:none; padding:0; margin:24px 0 0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;">
              <li style="display:flex; gap:10px; font-size:15px; color:#DBDEE1;"><span style="color:#2DD4BF;">✓</span> Per-guild subdomain or custom domain</li>
              <li style="display:flex; gap:10px; font-size:15px; color:#DBDEE1;"><span style="color:#2DD4BF;">✓</span> Privacy-aliased speakers, opt-in per guild</li>
              <li style="display:flex; gap:10px; font-size:15px; color:#DBDEE1;"><span style="color:#2DD4BF;">✓</span> JSON-LD + DB-driven sitemap, built for SEO</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div style="border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(244,245,255,0.1);">
            <div style="background:#EFEFF4; height:40px; display:flex; align-items:center; padding:0 14px; gap:7px;">
              <span style="width:11px; height:11px; border-radius:50%; background:#FF5F57;"></span>
              <span style="width:11px; height:11px; border-radius:50%; background:#FEBC2E;"></span>
              <span style="width:11px; height:11px; border-radius:50%; background:#28C840;"></span>
              <div style="margin-left:12px; background:#fff; border-radius:7px; height:24px; flex:1; max-width:300px; display:flex; align-items:center; padding:0 12px; font-size:12px; color:#6B7280; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;">helio.dejavue.app</div>
            </div>
            <div style="background:#FFFFFF; padding:30px 32px; color:#0E0F1C; min-height:330px;">
              <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; margin-bottom:22px;">
                <Echo tile="none" bubbleFill="#4F46E5" checkFill="#2DD4BF" echoFill="#A78BFA" echoOpacity={0.6} size={26} />
                <span style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:500; font-size:17px; letter-spacing:-0.03em; color:#0E0F1C;">Helio · Help Center</span>
                <span style="margin-left:auto; font-size:12px; color:#9AA0C3;">42 answers</span>
              </div>
              <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; color:#7C3AED; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase;">API · category</div>
              <h3 style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:26px; letter-spacing:-0.02em; margin:10px 0 6px; color:#0E0F1C; line-height:1.2;">How do I rotate my API key without downtime?</h3>
              <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#54586E; margin:12px 0 0;">Generate a second key from <strong style="color:#0E0F1C;">Settings → API</strong>, roll it out to your services, then revoke the old one. Both keys stay valid during the overlap, so there's no downtime.</p>
              <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:20px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <span style="background:#F1F0FB; color:#6D5FE8; font-size:12px; font-weight:500; padding:5px 11px; border-radius:999px;">api-keys</span>
                <span style="background:#F1F0FB; color:#6D5FE8; font-size:12px; font-weight:500; padding:5px 11px; border-radius:999px;">security</span>
                <span style="background:#E6FAF5; color:#0F9B82; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; padding:5px 11px; border-radius:999px;">✓ solved</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* ===== MCP CALLOUT ===== */}
